  "h1": "AI receptionist for hotels: a Prague pilot that answers in three languages",
  "lead": "I&#x27;m David Geha, an AI consultant in Beirut. In September 2026 I built and tested a pilot AI receptionist for a city hotel in Prague. It answers one phone line in Czech, English or German, books, changes and cancels rooms, and takes messages. It was a pilot demo, not a live deployment, and the hotel stays anonymous.",
